4️⃣ Security & Monitoring Questions
1. What is sudo?
Allows limited root access
Used for administrative commands
Improves security
Controlled via sudoers file
2. What are server backups?
Copies of system data
Protect against data loss
Used for recovery
Scheduled regularly
3. What is system monitoring?
Tracks server performance
Monitors CPU, RAM, disk
Detects issues early
Tools: Nagios, Zabbix
4. How to secure a Linux server?
Disable root login
Use strong passwords
Enable firewall
Keep system updated
